{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02498","headline":"奉述飞白书势 · 岑文本","name":"奉述飞白书势","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"六文开玉篆，八体曜银书。\n飞毫列锦绣，拂素起龙鱼。\n凤举崩云绝，鸾惊游雾疎。\n别有临池草，恩沾垂露余。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑文本","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02498.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02498","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}